      {
        "content": "Sheogorath's domain is Madness, creativity, the mind. The tenets of Sheogorath worship are: Pray often and receive Touch of Madness. Never disrespect cheese. The boons granted by Sheogorath are: Follower: Praying grants a random Touch of Madness. Devotee: Receive a Touch of Madness whenever you enter combat.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Sheogorath\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Sheogorath",
