      },
      {
        "content": "Sithis's domain is The Void, change, entropy, the Dark Brotherhood. The tenets of Sithis worship are: Murder the innocent. Pray while sacrificing a Human Heart or Flesh. Send victims to the Void. Argonians are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Sithis are: Follower: Harder to detect nearby; chance to find Human Hearts on kills. Devotee: Turn a door into a Void portal that pulls in and kills unaware targets.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Sithis\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Sithis",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_34",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
