        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Z'en's domain is Toil, payment in kind, the merchant lord. The tenets of Z'en worship are: Bribe people as needed. Harvest the fruits of nature. Eat as much food as you want. Those skilled in Speech are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Z'en are: Follower: Beneficial potions and food last longer and are better if consumed while praying. Devotee: Pray to open unlimited extradimensional storage.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Z'en\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Z'en",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_35",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
          "deity"
        ],
        "type": "KNOWLEDGE",
        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Satakal's domain is The world-eating serpent, the beginning and end of all things. The tenets of Satakal worship are: Fulfill your destiny by saving Tamriel. Strive to raise your Health. Absorb dragon souls. The boons granted by Satakal are: Follower: Shrine blessings from other gods are more effective and last longer. Devotee: Pray to become reborn, moving points between attributes.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Satakal\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Satakal",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_36",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
          "deity"
        ],
        "type": "KNOWLEDGE",
        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Tall Papa's domain is The overseer of all spirits, the highest of the Yokudan gods, endurance. The tenets of Tall Papa worship are: Touch the Fractures scattered around Skyrim. Create enchanted items. Those skilled in Enchanting are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Tall Papa are: Follower: Weapon enchantments drain less charge. Devotee: On death, enter ethereal state; if combat ends in time, revive.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Tall Papa\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Tall Papa",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_37",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
          "deity"
        ],
        "type": "KNOWLEDGE",
        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "the HoonDing's domain is Perseverance, the spirit of going forward, movement against all odds. The tenets of the HoonDing worship are: Slay your foes in open combat, especially those stronger. Those skilled in One-Handed are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by the HoonDing are: Follower: Staggering an opponent reduces their armor. Devotee: Chance to resist stagger from attacks and bashes.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"the HoonDing\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN the HoonDing",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_38",
        "tags": [
