        "type": "KNOWLEDGE",
        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "the Animal Gods's domain is The old animal god traditions; the Bear, the Crow, the Fox, the Hawk, the Snake, the Wolf. The tenets of the Animal Gods worship are: Slay people who stand in your way. Absorb dragon souls. Assume powers through prayer. Nords are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by the Animal Gods are: Follower: Sacrifice gemstones while praying to assume animal god powers. Devotee: Assume the powers of the Dragon.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"the Animal Gods\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN the Animal Gods",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_40",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
