        "type": "KNOWLEDGE",
        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Baan Dar's domain is Thieves, the bandit, clever tricks, the clever merchant. The tenets of Baan Dar worship are: Pick locks and pockets successfully. Khajiit and those skilled in Archery are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Baan Dar are: Follower: Buying from other races costs more, but pickpocketing is easier. Devotee: Put skooma in people's inventory, then pray to ignite them.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Baan Dar\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Baan Dar",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_41",
        "tags": [
