        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Ebonarm's domain is War, warriors, the Black Knight. The tenets of Ebonarm worship are: Slay daedra. Defeat epic foes. Complete miscellaneous quests. Those skilled in Block are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Ebonarm are: Follower: Attacks are more effective against daedra and their summoners. Devotee: Reduces armor of nearby enemies; you gain the total amount.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Ebonarm\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Ebonarm",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_42",
