      {
        "content": "Rajhin's domain is Thieves, rogues, the master thief, luck. The tenets of Rajhin worship are: Explore new locations. Bribe people. Pick locks. Those skilled in Lockpicking are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Rajhin are: Follower: Find additional gold in containers. Devotee: Pray to break a lock within 20 feet.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Rajhin\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Rajhin",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_43",
