      {
        "content": "Riddle'Thar's domain is The cosmic order of the moons, the Two-Moons Dance, Khajiiti faith. The tenets of Riddle'Thar worship are: Master skills of the Warrior, Thief and Mage equally. Strive to raise Health, Magicka and Stamina. Pray only at night. The boons granted by Riddle'Thar are: Follower: All skills improved. Devotee: An ancient Mane grants a blessing appropriate for upcoming challenges.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Riddle'Thar\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Riddle'Thar",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_44",
        "tags": [
