        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Morwha's domain is Love, fertility, the mother goddess of the Yokudan pantheon. The tenets of Morwha worship are: Be married. Receive the blessing of Lover's Comfort. Harvest the fruits of nature. Eat as much food as you want. The boons granted by Morwha are: Follower: Praying restores Health for you and nearby allies. Devotee: Praying blesses you with enchanted fruit.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Morwha\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Morwha",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_45",
