        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "Leki's domain is Sword-craft, the sublime art of the blade, the Saint of the Spirit Sword. The tenets of Leki worship are: Bring the Civil War to a conclusion. Make and improve weapons. Master the skills of the Warrior. The boons granted by Leki are: Follower: Power attacks ignore armor. Devotee: Spend favor to gain increased melee damage for 10 minutes.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Leki\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Leki",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_46",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
