        "type": "KNOWLEDGE",
        "emotion": "",
        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "the Hist's domain is The ancient trees of Black Marsh, Argonian souls, the Hist-sap. The tenets of the Hist worship are: Explore new locations. Slay daedra. Pray only outdoors. Never summon a daedra. The boons granted by the Hist are: Follower: Pray to gain a bonus to all attributes. Devotee: Absorb Magicka and Stamina of dead creatures and people nearby.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"the Hist\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN the Hist",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_47",
        "tags": [
