      },
      {
        "content": "St. Alessia's domain is The first Empress of Men, freedom, salvation, the Alessian Order. The tenets of St. Alessia worship are: Have a follower at your side. Slay elves. Receive the blessing of a Divine. The boons granted by St. Alessia are: Follower: Pray for a Divine blessing of your choice. Devotee: Talk to non-hostile humans to make them a friend and potential follower.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"St. Alessia\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN St. Alessia",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_48",
        "tags": [
