      },
      {
        "content": "Mannimarco's domain is Necromancy, undeath, the Worm Cult. The tenets of Mannimarco worship are: Trap souls. Pray only at night. Never accept Arkay's blessing. Those skilled in Conjuration are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by Mannimarco are: Follower: Undead conjured at night last longer. Devotee: Allied conjured undead deal more damage and regenerate Health.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"Mannimarco\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN Mannimarco",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_49",
        "tags": [
          "wintersun",
