        "location": ""
      },
      {
        "content": "the All-Maker's domain is The Skaal concept of the divine force that created all things. The tenets of the All-Maker worship are: Cleanse the All-Maker Stones. Hunt animals. Explore new locations. Pray only outdoors. Nords are most deserving of favor. The boons granted by the All-Maker are: Follower: Healing spells restore more Health. Devotee: After using an All-Maker Stone power, pray to have it restored.",
        "condition_expr": "get_name(actorUUID) == \"the All-Maker\"",
        "always_inject": true,
        "importance": 0.9,
        "display_name": "WSN the All-Maker",
        "knowledge_key": "wsn_deity_50",
